{"title": "Sethan: Spiritual Greataxe", "pageid": 20576, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sethan:_Spiritual_Greataxe", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 6 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Bonus actions", "Sources of Force damage", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp/300px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp, /w/images/8/8b/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp/300px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Sethan: Spiritual Greataxe</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 6 evocation spell</a>. This is a unique item spell allows the wielder of <a href=\"/wiki/Sethan\" title=\"Sethan\">Sethan</a> to summon an <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon_(greataxe)\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon (greataxe)\">ethereal greataxe</a> that can attack enemies.\n<p>This is equivalent to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Cleric</a> spell <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon:_Greataxe\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon: Greataxe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp/38px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp/50px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spiritual Weapon: Greataxe\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp/25px-Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Spiritual_Weapon_Greataxe_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spiritual_Weapon:_Greataxe\" title=\"Spiritual Weapon: Greataxe\">Spiritual Weapon: Greataxe</a> cast at level 6.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a spiritual twin of Sethan in a point you can see, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">3d8 + 1 + <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spellcasting_ability\" title=\"Spells\">Spellcasting modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage on a hit.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 4~25 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/26px-D8_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/40px-D8_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/53px-D8_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D8_Force.png/26px-D8_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D8_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">3d8 + 1 + <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spellcasting_ability\" title=\"Spells\">Spellcasting modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MAG_SpiritualStand_Greataxe</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_SpiritualStand_Greataxe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_SpiritualStand_Greataxe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-I